ravbot (0.3.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble Numbat)
  * High-performance C++17 AI assistant implementation
  * OpenClaw compatible workspace and protocol
  * Multi-provider LLM support (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Qwen)
  * WebSocket RPC gateway + HTTP REST API
  * Plugin ecosystem with Node.js sidecar
  * MCP (Model Context Protocol) support
  * Session persistence and context management
  * Skill system compatible with OpenClaw format
  * Security sandbox with RBAC and rate limiting
  * 886 passing tests

 -- RavBot Team <team@ravbot.io>  Sun, 16 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
